@startuml
title Model Loading Flow
hide footbox

participant "Caller" as Caller
participant "Load Handler" as Load
participant "Artifact Cache" as Cache
participant "Inference Plugin" as Plugin

Caller -> Load : Load source and configuration
Load -> Cache : Resolve local artifacts or fetch missing files
Cache --> Load : Resolved artifact paths

alt Resolved configuration already loaded
    Load -> Load : Add the caller's lease
else First load of this configuration
    Load -> Plugin : Evaluate fit if enabled and supported
    Plugin --> Load : Fit verdict
    break Policy refuses the load
        Load --> Caller : Model fit error
    end
    Load -> Plugin : Create and load model
    Plugin --> Load : Model instance
    Load -> Load : Register model and caller lease
end

Load --> Caller : Model ID
@enduml
